Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 21:10:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] Sidebar in macOS 26's order; sidebar and switches in
 the accent colour

Battery joins the network group; Notifications and Sound follow
Wallpaper; Privacy & Security moves beside Lock Screen. KDE pages move
to where macOS keeps the same settings: passwords, date & time and
login items in General, the default browser in Desktop & Dock, alert
sounds in Sound, the pointer and animations in Accessibility, spelling
in Keyboard, the splash screen in Lock Screen. The Passwords entry is
gone (macOS has none). Sidebar selection and switches use the accent
(Kirigami's focus colour) instead of a fixed blue.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KdkdNUmoM62iDwjRop6X5f
